  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per round</p><hr></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">You have practiced hands, able to reload weapons that have many moving parts quickly. You Reload twice. This would allow you to Reload two one-handed ranged weapons, reload two shots of a capacity weapon, or contribute two actions to replacing the magazine of a weapon with the repeating trait. If you have a weapon with Reload 1, you can Reload and Strike, or Strike and Reload.</p>"
